    "Refine image 1, a flat-lit render of a 3D asset, using image 2 as the guide for its surface details. Add the letters, runes, symbols, emblems, ornaments, embroidery and painted designs from image 2 where they belong on image 1, and sharpen every edge and pattern with fine, realistic micro-detail that suits each material: weave on fabric, grain on leather and wood, scratches on metal, pores on skin, strands in hair and fur. Keep the shapes, pose, framing, overall color scheme and plain background of image 1. Flat, even, shadowless lighting."
