     "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
    }
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "### FLUX.2 [klein] 4B refiner - every file Apache-2.0 (commercial use OK)\n* `diffusion_models/flux-2-klein-4b-Q8_0.gguf` (ComfyUI-GGUF 'Unet Loader (GGUF)', Apache-2.0)\n  or `flux-2-klein-4b-fp8.safetensors` with the core 'Load Diffusion Model'.\n* `text_encoders/Qwen3-4B-Q8_0.gguf`, type **flux2** ('CLIPLoader (GGUF)') or `qwen_3_4b.safetensors` with 'Load CLIP'.\n* `vae/flux2-vae.safetensors`. **Never** the klein **9B** or FLUX.2 [dev] files: non-commercial licence.\n* **Steps per run** = steps x denoise, rounded (8 x 0.4 = 3). **Runs** = tiles: views x tiles per view, x2 with cancel_lighting (4 views at 2048 = 4 x 4 x 2 = 32 runs).\n* `denoise` = how much FLUX may change: with 8 steps, 0.4 starts at ~85 % noise (FLUX redraws each tile). 0.3 = more faithful, 0.45-0.5 = takes more from the reference.\n* Prompts: say what you WANT (FLUX.2 has no negative prompt)."
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000",
   "id": 36,
   "order": 35
