     "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
    }
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "### Enhance ANY textured mesh\n* A .glb / .gltf / .obj **with a texture**: old assets, other generators, a TRELLIS result (or any node that outputs a textured MESH, e.g. 'Get 3D Components').\n* Views are flat and **unlit**: no light, no shadows - lighting stays dynamic in your engine.\n* Set for the best detail on **4K textures**: resolution 2048 + tile_size 1088 (4 tiles per view). Faster: resolution 1024 (1 tile per view) or cancel_lighting off (half the runs). 8 views also cover tops (2x the runs).\n* *cancel_lighting* (Split Tiles) refines every tile twice, the second time upside down: painted light cancels out.\n* *keep_colors* (Merge Tiles): FLUX's greying / tinting / re-lighting of what is there is taken out; new detail and new coloured features (letters, symbols from the reference) stay. *detail_size* = how large those features may be.\n* *Project Views*: detail_radius 16 takes detail and features; 6 = fine detail only (strictest). No painted light, no colour casts, no dot patterns; what no view sees well stays exactly as it was."
   ],
   "color": "#222",
   "bgcolor": "#000",
   "id": 49,
   "order": 48
  }
